    <dashboard name='Story 1' type='storyboard'>
      <layout-options>
        <title>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#1b1b1b'>EV Market Performance &amp; Insights</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
      </layout-options>
      <style>
        <style-rule element='table'>
          <format attr='background-color' value='#fffffff9' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-description'>
          <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-point-caption'>
          <format attr='font-size' value='10' />
          <format attr='font-weight' value='bold' />
          <format attr='color' value='#333333' />
        </style-rule>
        <style-rule element='story-title'>
          <format attr='text-align' value='auto' />
          <format attr='color' value='#f28e2b' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='2' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98014' id='1' param='vert' removable='false' type-v2='layout-flow' w='99002' x='499' y='993'>
            <zone h='6203' id='3' type-v2='title' w='99002' x='499' y='993' />
            <zone h='12531' id='4' is-fixed='true' paired-zone-id='5' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard-nav' w='99002' x='499' y='7196' />
            <zone h='79280' id='5' paired-zone-id='4' removable='false' type-v2='flipboard' w='99002' x='499' y='19727'>
              <flipboard active-id='1' nav-type='caption' show-nav-arrows='true'>
                <story-points>
                  <story-point caption='Global EV Market Scale &amp; milestone' captured-sheet='EV MARKET DASHBOARD' id='1'>
                    <capturedDeltas>
                      <worksheet name='Sheet 9'>
                        <selection-collection />
                      </worksheet>
                    </capturedDeltas>
                  </story-point>
                  <story-point caption='Sales Trend Analysis(2024-2026).' captured-sheet='Sheet 2' id='2' />
                  <story-point caption='Battery Technology Market Share Analysis' captured-sheet='Sheet 10' id='3' />
                  <story-point caption=' Market Share by Manufacturer' captured-sheet='Sheet 11' id='4' />
                  <story-point caption='Distinct Vehicle Counts across Segments' captured-sheet='Sheet 3' id='5' />
                  <story-point caption='Customer Engagement &amp; rating Analysis' captured-sheet='Sheet 9' id='6' />
                  <story-point caption='Key Insights' captured-sheet='' id='7' />
                </story-points>
              </flipboard>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='76923' hidden='true' id='6' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='91283' x='430' y='18983'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Overall EV Sales</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>The dashboard records total annual sales of 1,550,703,961 units across the dataset, providing an overview of the EV market&apos;s scale.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Regional Sales performance</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#1b1b1b' fontsize='10'>Annual sales appear relatively similar across the displayed market regions.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Battery Technology market Share</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>LFP batteries hold the largest market share at 33.80%, followed by NCA at 31.99%, while Solid-State batteries have the smallest share at 7.10%.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Market Share by Manufacturer</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>AmpereWorks leads the displayed manufacturers with approximately 10.72% market share, folowed by CircuitWorks at around 10.12%.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Customer rating Analysis </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>Customer rating records vary across EV categories.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>* Category-wise Sales Distribution</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='10'>The pie chart shows that sales are distributed across multiple EV categories rather than being represented by a single category.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{F35868F6-DB9D-44CD-AFA2-6C514068FD44}' />
    </dashboard>
